Future architecture (after RustyUI migration): revisit a common RustyRig node for rrclient/rrserver, with detachable GTK/TUI frontends, shared models and persistent network/DSP state. Investigate process isolation for X display-loss recovery, reattachment to a new DISPLAY, multiple simultaneous frontends, and preservation of server authorization boundaries. Do not merge executables until these boundaries are established.
